web: let a page that hosts the server's workbench add non-JSON construction options

The server renders workbench.html with the workbench's options as JSON in a <meta> element, and workbench.ts passes them to create().
Options that are functions or providers (IWorkbenchConstructionOptions.webSocketFactory, resourceUriProvider, commands, ...) cannot be
written as JSON, so a page that serves the same workbench bundle itself (an embedder with its own transport to the server, here a vmapp
window whose only channel to the server is an IPC bridge) has no way to supply them without rebuilding the entry point.

This adds one optional global, read once at startup: globalThis.vscodeWebEmbedderOptions, a Partial<IWorkbenchConstructionOptions> that
the embedding page defines before the workbench module runs. Its options are applied last. Nothing changes when it is not defined, which
is always the case for the page the server renders.

--- a/src/vs/code/browser/workbench/workbench.ts
+++ b/src/vs/code/browser/workbench/workbench.ts
@@ -618,16 +618,22 @@
 	const secretStorageKeyPath = readCookie('vscode-secret-key-path');
 	const secretStorageCrypto = secretStorageKeyPath && ServerKeyedAESCrypto.supported()
 		? new ServerKeyedAESCrypto(secretStorageKeyPath) : new TransparentCrypto();

+	// A page that serves this workbench itself, instead of the server, can add the options that cannot be written as JSON in the
+	// configuration element (functions and providers: `webSocketFactory`, `resourceUriProvider`, `commands`, ...). It defines them on
+	// `globalThis.vscodeWebEmbedderOptions` before this module runs; they are applied last.
+	const embedderOptions = (globalThis as { vscodeWebEmbedderOptions?: Partial<IWorkbenchConstructionOptions> }).vscodeWebEmbedderOptions;
+
 	// Create workbench
 	create(mainWindow.document.body, {
 		...config,
 		windowIndicator: config.windowIndicator ?? { label: '$(remote)', tooltip: `${product.nameShort} Web` },
 		settingsSyncOptions: config.settingsSyncOptions ? { enabled: config.settingsSyncOptions.enabled, } : undefined,
 		workspaceProvider: WorkspaceProvider.create(config),
 		urlCallbackProvider: new LocalStorageURLCallbackProvider(config.callbackRoute),
 		secretStorageProvider: config.remoteAuthority && !secretStorageKeyPath
 			? undefined /* with a remote without embedder-preferred storage, store on the remote */
 			: new LocalStorageSecretStorageProvider(secretStorageCrypto),
+		...embedderOptions,
 	});
 })();
